   "like_count": 4,
   "cooked": "<p><strong><img alt=\":ballot_box:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/ballot_box.png?v=9\" title=\":ballot_box:\"/> <a href=\"https://tokenlog.xyz/CommonsBuild/TokenLog-SoftGov\">Vote on MVV Now! </a> <img alt=\":ballot_box:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/ballot_box.png?v=9\" title=\":ballot_box:\"/></strong></p>\n<hr/>\n<p>The <strong>top 3 submissions</strong> of the first MVV round were collectively edited and are now available on <a href=\"https://tokenlog.xyz/CommonsBuild/TokenLog-SoftGov\">Tokenlog</a>. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/juankbell\">@Juankbell</a> submitted the 3 proposals with numbers rather than titles so the writers are anonymous to not influence the votes. <strong>Deadline:</strong> Tuesday, April 27th during the Soft Gov call at 7pm CET.</p>\n<h3>Every CSTK and IH token holders can vote. Your economy, your choice <img alt=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\"/>\n</h3>\n<p><img alt=\":gear:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/gear.png?v=9\" title=\":gear:\"/> <strong>Step 1</strong> - Change your wallet network to xDAI</p>\n<ul>\n<li>if you don’t have xDAI added to your networks <a href=\"https://www.xdaichain.com/for-users/wallets/metamask/metamask-setup\">click here</a> for simple instructions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\":mag_right:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/mag_right.png?v=9\" title=\":mag_right:\"/> <strong>Step 2</strong> - Click the number on the right corner of the issue to open it.<br/>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2021-04-20 at 4.02.16 PM\"><img alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-04-20 at 4.02.16 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"wCKvFfOPGWcD2CaKlFIMWrielyd\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d_2_10x10.png\" height=\"145\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d_2_690x145.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d_2_690x145.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d_2_1035x217.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e4a6ee454042d30339b61b2c96ac3bda2e32ab6d_2_1380x290.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screen Shot 2021-04-20 at 4.02.16 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1536×324 28.3 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p><img alt=\":heart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heart.png?v=9\" title=\":heart:\"/> <strong>Step 3</strong> - Pick your favorite one and vote!</p>\n<p><strong>Good to know:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://tokenlog.xyz/CommonsBuild/TokenLog-SoftGov\">Tokenlog</a> uses quadradic voting - <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/how-to-rock-the-vote-with-tokenlogs-quadratic-voting/317\">read more about it</a>\n</li>\n<li>It’s a soft gov tool, so despite the use of tokens, nothing happens on chain</li>\n<li>There is no way to change your votes once they’re submitted</li>\n<li>Vote as much as you want as long as you have a token balance.</li>\n<li>You can read more about the <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/mission-vision-and-values-tokenlog-session/296\">previous sessions.</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
