   "cooked": "<p>A super easy way to add a network to MetaMask is by heading over to <a href=\"https://Chainlist\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://chainlist.org/</a><br/>\nA few simple steps and you’ll have it set up:<br/>\n1 - Connect your wallet<br/>\n2 - Find the network<br/>\n3 - Click Add to MetaMask<br/>\n4 - Click Approve in MetaMask</p>\n<p>It will setup using <a href=\"https://rpc.xdaichain.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://rpc.xdaichain.com</a> however I find the 1hive rpc runs smoother. <a href=\"https://xdai.1hive.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://xdai.1hive.org</a></p>",
